# Optional. Unset, the game makes no network calls at all and the canon panel never appears —
# which is the default and what CI runs.
#
# Set it to switch on "Ask the canon": the sidebar can then query the canon service for what
# the database knows about the tile you are standing on. See services/api/README.md in the
# SouthOfTethys repo for how to run that service.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and uncomment:
# VITE_CANON_API=http://localhost:8000
